**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      OUTPUT-INTERRUPT GENERATE SUBROUTINE                          *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION  THE PURPOSE OF THIS SUBRROUTINE IS TO PROVIDE AN INTERRUPT
*           AFTER CERTAIN COMPUTER TELEMETRY OPERATIONS.
*           AFTER ISSUING THE INTERRUPT (DO2) TO THE LAUNCH COMPUTER,
*           THIS SUBROUTINE WAITS 1 MS. FOR THE SYNC SIGNAL FROM THE
*           LAUNCH COMPUTER. WHEN SYNC IS DETECTED, THE SUBROUTINE
*           ISSUES SYNC RESET AND RETURNS TO CALLING ROUTINE.

* ENTRY     OIGS     ENTER TO GENERATE OUTPUT-INTERRUPT

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
OIGSRT BSS     1

OIGS   STO     777
       CLA     777
       STO     OIGSRT

       HOP     PRUS         PTL REALTIME UPDATE SUBR.                 P

       CLA     D.KB11
       PIO     016          SET DISCRETE OUTPUT NUMBER 2              B
       TRA     *            FIXME: NOT DONE YET
